from clockutil import expired
class Cache:
 data={}
 def __init__(self,clock): self.clock=clock
 def set(self,k,v,ttl): self.data[k]=(v,self.clock()+ttl)
 def get(self,k):
  if k not in self.data: return None
  v,end=self.data[k]
  if expired(self.clock(),end): return None
  return v

